knows what happened here.

259
00:15:58,920 --> 00:16:03,657
With two emperors out of the picture, we'll
be the prime candidates to replace them.

260
00:16:03,740 --> 00:16:05,000
That's exactly right.

261
00:16:05,420 --> 00:16:08,017
This country may isolate
us from our enemies,

262
00:16:08,100 --> 00:16:11,100
but we don't know what
they're plotting now either.

263
00:16:11,400 --> 00:16:13,757
I bet the bounties for
our captains went up!

264
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:16,487
That makes me feel cool,
but it's also scary!

265
00:16:18,980 --> 00:16:19,810
You're right!

266
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:22,000
The bounties went up, sure enough.

267
00:16:22,120 --> 00:16:25,120
Don't know who leaked the
info, though. Oh, Pooh!

268
00:16:25,300 --> 00:16:27,476
Don't play dumb with us, you jackass!

269
00:16:27,600 --> 00:16:29,540
We all know you leaked it!

270
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:34,760
I left the news out, but
I let some news in, too!

271
00:16:36,460 --> 00:16:37,760
Check it out, yo!

272
00:16:40,940 --> 00:16:46,337
Fresh off the presses, brand spanking new
bounties, as well as some familiar faces?

273
00:16:46,420 --> 00:16:49,480
who have just been dubbed
emperors of the sea.

274
00:16:54,100 --> 00:16:56,680
I asked where you are right now, damn it.

275
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:59,288
What do you mean, Sakazuki?

276
00:16:59,440 --> 00:17:00,969
I told you I'm in the air.

277
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,520
The air over what, exactly?

278
00:17:04,880 --> 00:17:08,360
Well, I can see the land of
Wano from here, if that helps.

279
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:11,565
Don't do anything unnecessary.

280
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,040
You hear me?

281
00:17:14,820 --> 00:17:15,650
Riyakukyu!

282
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:19,957
I understand, boss.

283
00:17:20,040 --> 00:17:22,020
You bet I do.
